  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pramendra Sah vs The General Manager on 28 June, 2022",
    "facts": "The present writ petition has been filed for a direction to the respondents to transfer vending contract in the name of the petitioners at the place of their father who has died. II. Whether non consideration of the claim of the petitioners is justified.\"",
    "arguments": "The same reads as under: \"I. According to the food safety and standards Act, 2006, Section (31), Sub-Section 10 license shall transfer to the deceased's personal representative or any member of his family it is stated as:- (31) (10) The license shall subsist for the benefit of the deceased's personal representative or any other member of his family, until the expiry of :- (a) The period of three months beginning with his death; or (b) Such longer period as the Designated Officer may allow.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": "The same reads as under: \"I. According to the food safety and standards Act, 2006, Section (31), Sub-Section 10 license shall transfer to the deceased's personal representative or any member of his family it is stated as:- (31) (10) The license shall subsist for the benefit of the deceased's personal representative or any other member of his family, until the expiry of :- (a) The period of three months beginning with his death; or (b) Such longer period as the Designated Officer may allow."
